<title>USA: Allegiant declares higher payout.</title>
<headline>Allegiant declares higher payout.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.03		    $0.025</p>
<p> Pay		  April 15</p>
<p> Record	     March 31</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Allegiant Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: On October 24, Allegiant said it would raise its dividend beginning with the one paid in April to $0.03 a share from $0.025.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
